        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>Formatter parity divergence for (sp031-04-between-in, ansi). Either fix the formatter or register the divergence in ParityDispositionsRegistry with a ReasonLink to a spec-020 tasks.md entry.

=== DIFF (expected → actual) ===
L   1  -: select o.orderid&#xD;&#xD;
